toring server) to request commands to be run on this machine (the monitored machine) which return the status of the machine.\n- Submit the same results to a remote (monitoring server).\n- Take action and perform tasks.","moniker":"nscp","name":"NSClient++","packageUrl":"https://nsclient.org/","publisher":"MySolutions NORDIC","publisherUrl":"https://medin.name/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/tag/0.12.3","tags":["icinga","naemon","nagios"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"可与多种监控工具协同使用的全功能监控代理","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"NSClient++（nscp）旨在成为一个简单而强大且安全的监控守护进程。它最初为 Nagios/Icinga 设计，但守护进程本身并不局限于 Nagios/Icinga，可广泛应用于需要接收或分发检查指标的其他场景中。\n该守护进程主要具备三项核心功能：\n- 允许远程主机（监控服务器）请求在本机（被监控主机）上执行命令，以获取主机状态信息。\n- 将相同的检测结果主动提交至远程（监控服务器）。\n- 执行预设操作并完成任务处理。","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/tag/0.12.3","tags":[]}},"publisherUrl":"https://medin.name/","releaseDate":"2026-05-11","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/mickem/nscp/releases/tag/0.12.3","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/m/Mickem/NSClient/0.12.3.0/Mickem.NSClient.yaml","sha256":"d6b53ad3797d9fdae9eb75b13c0415212f024c5ba4bb1fe62d5f7a08b6bddfac"},{"path":"manifests/m/Mickem/NSClient/0.12.3.0/Mickem.NSClient.installer.yaml","sha256":"3560ea80f17081a7b8deb6e0e945f7b5db7c35cffd7218c727e597ac30def4ca"},{"path":"manifests/m/Mickem/NSClient/0.12.3.0/Mickem.NSClient.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"f28bb65f7bdcbc412015af8f7f3b74d4210b93f2b785bbf97cea471698b5655b"},{"path":"manifests/m/Mickem/NSClient/0.12.3.0/Mickem.NSClient.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"465d5e8deb40e5976aafbefab9af86458682ebba0b21fc98aadbadeb5681bb80"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.12.3.0"}